# An allowlist: the image is built from exactly what the product runs, so nothing else -- a local
# `.env`, an API-key file, a virtualenv, research data, the git history -- can reach the build.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
!migrations/
!scripts/migrate.py
!deployment/docker/
deployment/docker/llm-keys.env
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
